BEGIN:VCALENDAR
VERSION:2.0
PRODID:-//Kasten fixtures//This and all following occurrences (RFC 5545 3.2.13)//EN
X-WR-CALNAME:This and future (fixture)
X-NOTE:Each case is a series and the changes made to it, all with one UID. The series carries
X-NOTE: what a reader must show: X-EXPECT;VIEWER=<zone> is the list of starts on that
X-NOTE: viewer's clock, X-TITLES the titles in the same order. Mondays are 2026-10-05, 12, 19, 26.
X-NOTE: New York leaves summer time on 2026-11-01, London on 2026-10-25.
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:tf-a@fixture.example
X-CASE:A. A weekly series, from the third on at 10:30
SUMMARY:Weekly review
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261005T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261005T100000
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;COUNT=6
X-EXPECT;VIEWER=America/New_York:20261005T090000,20261012T090000,20261019T103000,20261026T103000,20261102T103000,20261109T103000
X-EXPECT;VIEWER=UTC:20261005T130000,20261012T130000,20261019T143000,20261026T143000,20261102T153000,20261109T153000
X-TITLES:Weekly review|Weekly review|Weekly review (new time)|Weekly review (new time)|Weekly review (new time)|Weekly review (new time)
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:tf-a@fixture.example
SUMMARY:Weekly review (new time)
RECURRENCE-ID;RANGE=THISANDFUTURE;TZID=America/New_York:20261019T090000
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261019T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261019T113000
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:tf-b@fixture.example
